[N 24-25 Ashenvale]
[D Forever Druid 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Ashenvale's west half: Maestra's Post, Astranaar, Lake Mystral and the Zoram Strand - plain kill and collect chains, one escort, ending at the mouth of Blackfathom Deeps.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffAshenvale 24-25|r  -  you start at Maestra's Post (26,38), the Night Elf camp on the west-coast road where chapter 11 ended, at level ~24. Hearth = Sentinel Hill and it stays there (Blackfathom ends with the hearth). ~23,500 quest XP of normal kill/collect work plus one escort (2,900 XP) and the Ruuzel fight, in one big loop: plant glade, Astranaar, the pool, Thistlefur, the coast murlocs, the south (Ilkrud, Lake Mystral, the Foulweald den), Feero's escort, then the Zoram Strand and the Blackfathom cave
[OC]|cffffcc00Naming:|r the camp at 26,38 is Maestra's Post (Delgren, Orendil and Feero stand here). The real Forest Song is the east camp where Kayneth Stillwind lives (chapter 21)
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r nothing in Ashenvale trains you. If you skipped your level-24 ranks (Rake, Tiger's Fury, Ferocious Bite) in Darnassus, Sheldras Moontree in the Stormwind Park trains them with 25 and 26 (chapter 15)

[OC]|cffffffffMaestra's Post|r
[OC]|cffffcc00Carry-in:|r chapter 11 should have left you Delgren's The Tower of Althalaxx part 3 (973, Ilkrud's Tome) - it is finished on the south loop below. If your log shows part 2 (970) instead, use the two optional lines marked 970
At [TAR3847 Orendil Broadleaf], [QA1010 Bathran's Hair] (5 Bathran's Hair from plant bundles in the glade north-east of camp - |cff66ff66normal|r, 14 spawn points) [G26.4,38.6 Ashenvale]
[O]Only if 970 is still in your log: kill Dark Strand cultists (18-21) on the way for a Glowing Soul Gem [QC970] [G31.5,30.5 Ashenvale]
[OC]|cffffcc00The plant glade|r is a Forsaken camp: Seekers and Herbalists (18-19), Thugs (20). Apothecary Falthis (22, rare elite in the DB) can wander in - leave him alone, pull the rest one at a time
Loot 5 Bathran's Hair from the plant bundles [QC1010] [G31.7,23.0 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3847 Orendil Broadleaf], [QT1010] [QA1020 Orendil's Cure] (1,950 XP - the cure goes to Pelturas in Astranaar) [G26.4,38.6 Ashenvale]
