[OC]|cffffcc00Drop rate unknown:|r Befouled Water Elementals (23-25) around Lake Mystral are the only source of the 5 Intact Elemental Bracers (Tideress, a level 27 in the DB, drops them too); neither the DB nor the wiki gives a rate. Give it about 20 kills - if you hold fewer than 3 bracers by then, drop 1016 and move on
